e poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1671410/extras/a701ccfed5df9481e2162ad857e718f9.poster.avif?t=1696415061\" width=598 height=208 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1671410/extras/a701ccfed5df9481e2162ad857e718f9.webm?t=1696415061\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1671410/extras/a701ccfed5df9481e2162ad857e718f9.mp4?t=1696415061\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1671410/extras/c4a8180a6bada625ca8130c263243207.webp?t=1696415061\" width=600 height=32 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE INVASION    </strong></h2>Live through the personal struggles of a young family separated in the final moments of a global conflict against a hostile alien civilisation. Discover first hand the full impact on others of this catastrophic event.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1671410/extras/66558f3fcc6cf37181e6f8fd81587c08.poster.avif?t=1696415061\" width=600 height=202 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1671410/extras/66558f3fcc6cf37181e6f8fd81587c08.webm?t=1696415061\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1671410/extras/66558f3fcc6cf37181e6f8fd81587c08.mp4?t=1696415061\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1671410/extras/c4a8180a6bada625ca8130c263243207.webp?t=1696415061\" width=600 height=32 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EXPLORE , LEARN , COMMUNICATE    </strong></h2>Explore the devastation left behind by 